// expect: 18
// A claim of 4 MB on `main` sizes the arenas' journal to a quarter of it,
// 1 MB, so the module starts in the 18 pages its data, its dispatch memo and
// that journal take, where a module with an arena and no claim starts in 34.
// `memory_pages` reads the pages the program holds.
import arena

fn main() with Footprint(4194304) = memory_pages() ~> arena
